{"blocks":[["Lazygit/Command/Custom/","source-block-164","If you have implemented a custom command(s) that you find useful, please add it here so others can find it too. If a particular command proves popular, we will merge it into the codebase for all to use.",["lazygit custom commands","Custom Commands Compendium · jesseduffield/lazygit Wiki"]],["Lazygit/Command/Custom/","source-block-371","If you want to know how to implement your own custom commands see here",["lazygit custom commands","Custom Commands Compendium · jesseduffield/lazygit Wiki"]],["Lazygit/Install/","source-block-0","Brew brew install lazygit",[]],["Lazygit/Install/","source-block-34","There is a third-party DevContainer/Feature dev container feature based on the binary releases for Codespaces",[]],["Lazygit/Install/","source-block-236","when you first start it up, you're going to see a TUI UX/Screen/Splash",[]],["Lazygit/Keyshort/","source-block-34","Summary: 5 items, 4 review counts 2026-04-14 Tue",[]],["Lazygit/Keyshort/","source-block-90","Remembered: 2 (50%)",["Summary: 5 items, 4 review counts 2026-04-14 Tue"]],["Lazygit/Keyshort/","source-block-116","Forgotten : 2 (50%)",["Summary: 5 items, 4 review counts 2026-04-14 Tue"]],["Lazygit/Keyshort/","source-block-142","Summary: 7 items, 7 review counts 2026-02-18 Wed",[]],["Lazygit/Keyshort/","source-block-198","Remembered: 3 (42%)",["Summary: 7 items, 7 review counts 2026-02-18 Wed"]],["Lazygit/Keyshort/","source-block-224","Forgotten : 4 (57%)",["Summary: 7 items, 7 review counts 2026-02-18 Wed"]],["Lazygit/Keyshort/Commit/","source-block-0","Keyshort Lazygit Lazygit/Keyshort",[]],["Lazygit/Keyshort/Commit/","source-block-48","Commit Staged Changes Card",["Keyshort Lazygit Lazygit/Keyshort"]],["Lazygit/Keyshort/Commit/","source-block-86","Shortcut: c",["Keyshort Lazygit Lazygit/Keyshort","Commit Staged Changes Card"]],["Lazygit/Keyshort/Commit/","source-block-104","Description: Opens an inline message input for the staged changes. C opens the 